<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Kaibil Balam</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">fl. 1525</span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Kaibil Balam was the ruler of the Mam Maya kingdom in the western highlands of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/guatemala">Guatemala</a> at the time of the Spanish conquest. In 1525 <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gonzalo-de-alvarado">Gonzalo de Alvarado</a> besieged his fortified capital of Zaculeu for several months, and Kaibil Balam surrendered when his people were starving, ending the Mam kingdom.</p></div>
